 "headline": "Quentin Grimes Is Carrying Thug Life",
 "notes": [
  "Thug Life now holds the AST lead after BrookynDynasty coughed it up, and Karl-Anthony Towns has 20 points, 12 boards and 3 blocks doing the damage.",
  "Zero Fox Given grabbed FG% and 3PT% from Nova Knicks while Nova's own Victor Wembanyama keeps dropping 26 and 10, which should be a crime against the standings.",
  "De'Aaron Fox is 0-for-2 with 6 points for Nova Knicks. The manager is leaning on pickups to cover for a star who showed up in name only.",
  "Bones Hyland has 6 points on 2-of-5 for BrookynDynasty, who are sinking in the standings tonight and mailing it in the way Hyland shoots.",
  "Gopher Gold took BLK from Suggs to be you, and Yaxel Lendeborg is sitting on 11, 8 and 7 while Suggs gets embarrassed on the glass."
 ],
